    // The cabin's room faces +X to its hearth and -Z to its door. Two windows sit in the door wall at x -2.5 and
    // x 2.5 and one in the +Z wall at x -1, each at a height of 1.3 to 2.45; the one in the -X end wall sits 6 cm
